{'symbol': 'APTV', 'date': '2023-05-18 16:30:00', 'title': 'APTIV DECLARES QUARTERLY PREFERRED SHARE DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DUBLIN , MAY 18, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- APTIV PLC (NYSE: APTV) \xa0A GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY COMPANY FOCUSED ON MAKING MOBILITY SAFER, GREENER AND MORE CONNECTED, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.375 PER SHARE ON ITS 5.50% SERIES A MANDATORY CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED SHARES, PAYABLE ON JUNE 15, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 1, 2023. ABOUT APTIV APTIV IS A GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT DEVELOPS SAFER, GREENER AND MORE CONNECTED SOLUTIONS ENABLING A MORE SUSTAINABLE FUTURE OF MOBILITY.'}